#: jsopts.cpp:60
msgid ""
"Enables the execution of scripts written in ECMA-Script (as known as JavaScri"
"pt) that can be contained in HTML pages. Be aware that JavaScript support is "
"not yet finished. Note that, as with any browser, enabling scripting language"
"s can be a security problem."
